WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.501 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Welcome.
-Thank you so much, guys.

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:02.369 line:92%
-I'm so happy to have you here.

00:00:02.369 --> 00:00:04.771 align:start size:94% position:6%
And this is a very
short commute for you today,

00:00:04.771 --> 00:00:05.805 line:92%
because you were down the hall,

00:00:05.805 --> 00:00:07.540 align:start size:94% position:6%
getting ready to
host "Saturday Night Live."

00:00:07.540 --> 00:00:10.577
-I'm down the hall, yeah.
-Yeah. How is it feeling so far?

00:00:10.577 --> 00:00:15.582 align:start size:94% position:6%
-It's mental.
Like, it moves so quickly.

00:00:15.582 --> 00:00:16.149 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
It's amazing.

00:00:16.149 --> 00:00:19.285 size:78% position:39%
We started yesterday,
and I met everyone

00:00:19.285 --> 00:00:21.087 line:92%
and went into Lorne's office.

00:00:21.087 --> 00:00:23.757 align:start size:94% position:6%
And all I talked about
was the goldfish

00:00:23.757 --> 00:00:26.393
that he had in his tank, 'cause
I didn't know what else to do.

00:00:26.393 --> 00:00:27.894 align:start size:94% position:6%
I was like,
"Oh, look at those --

00:00:27.894 --> 00:00:29.829 line:92%
Great view out your window."

00:00:29.829 --> 00:00:33.500 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I wonder how many times
over the last 40-plus years,

00:00:33.500 --> 00:00:34.367 size:81% position:41% line:92%
he's had people, like,

00:00:34.367 --> 00:00:37.170 size:84% position:42%
panic and just start
talking about his fish.

00:00:37.170 --> 00:00:39.706 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I honestly don't know
what I said.

00:00:39.706 --> 00:00:40.473 size:81% position:41% line:92%
But, yeah, it's great.

00:00:40.473 --> 00:00:42.175 align:start size:94% position:6%
And it's also great
that you're here,

00:00:42.175 --> 00:00:44.511 align:start size:94% position:6%
and there's always,
like, so much going on.

00:00:44.511 --> 00:00:46.713 align:start size:94% position:6%
-There is a lot going on
in the building.

00:00:46.713 --> 00:00:47.814 line:92%
And it's a very special "SNL."

00:00:47.814 --> 00:00:49.816 align:start size:94% position:6%
I want to know if
it's special for you,

00:00:49.816 --> 00:00:50.917 line:92%
because it's very Irish-themed.

00:00:50.917 --> 00:00:53.253 align:start size:94% position:6%
You're the host,
and U2 is the musical guest.

00:00:53.253 --> 00:00:53.686 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah.

00:00:53.686 --> 00:00:56.122
-Are you proud to be a part
of this Irish-themed "SNL" week?

00:00:56.122 --> 00:00:57.457 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah. Like,
it feels like the Irish are

00:00:57.457 --> 00:01:01.861 align:start size:94% position:6%
taking over "SNL" for
the whole week, as we should.

00:01:01.861 --> 00:01:04.731 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-It's about time.

00:01:04.731 --> 00:01:06.766 align:start size:94% position:6%
-This has long been
feared in New York,

00:01:06.766 --> 00:01:07.567 line:92%
and now it's coming to pass.

00:01:07.567 --> 00:01:09.669 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You knew it was gonna happen
one day, New York.

00:01:09.669 --> 00:01:11.004 align:start size:94% position:6%
-There were --
Like, in the early 1900s,

00:01:11.004 --> 00:01:12.872 size:81% position:41%
that's when we thought
it was gonna happen,

00:01:12.872 --> 00:01:13.540 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
and now here it is.

00:01:13.540 --> 00:01:15.842
-There have been meetings
between Bono and meself.

00:01:15.842 --> 00:01:17.343
-Yeah.
Do you feel a connection to U2?

00:01:17.343 --> 00:01:19.813
Did you care a great deal about
them, being from Ireland?

00:01:19.813 --> 00:01:20.447 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah, absolutely.

00:01:20.447 --> 00:01:25.085
I mean, I love their music
and I know them a little bit,

00:01:25.085 --> 00:01:26.386 size:75% position:38% line:92%
and they're amazing.

00:01:26.386 --> 00:01:29.789 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I think the great thing,
like, about Irish people,

00:01:29.789 --> 00:01:30.790 align:start size:94% position:6%
even, like,
well-known Irish people,

00:01:30.790 --> 00:01:33.026
is that we're all just very,
very familiar with each other.

00:01:33.026 --> 00:01:35.361 align:start size:94% position:6%
So, like, the first time I met
them, it was like,

00:01:35.361 --> 00:01:37.630
"Oh, Jesus. Hey, how's it going?
How's the family?

00:01:37.630 --> 00:01:41.101 align:start size:94% position:6%
And, like, I've never
met these people before.

00:01:41.101 --> 00:01:43.903 align:start size:94% position:6%
But, no, there's
a huge sense of, like,

00:01:43.903 --> 00:01:44.671 size:84% position:42% line:92%
national pride at them,

00:01:44.671 --> 00:01:46.639 align:start size:94% position:6%
'cause they're our
biggest success story.

00:01:46.639 --> 00:01:48.708 align:start size:94% position:6%
So to get to do
the show with them is great.

00:01:48.708 --> 00:01:51.778
-That's really awesome.
Now, were you a fan of the show?

00:01:51.778 --> 00:01:53.146 line:92%
Do you have a favorite "SNL"

00:01:53.146 --> 00:01:54.514 align:start size:94% position:6%
character, sketch
over the years?

00:01:54.514 --> 00:01:57.650
-I love -- I mean, I loved all
of the sketches that you wrote.

00:01:57.650 --> 00:02:00.453 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, please. Don't.
-Every single one.

00:02:00.453 --> 00:02:04.124 align:start size:94% position:6%
-This is some real Irish charm
happening right here.

00:02:04.124 --> 00:02:06.826
-All your sketches are so smart.
-Thank you. Thank you.

00:02:06.826 --> 00:02:08.428 align:start size:94% position:6%
You know, I thought,
because you seem really smart,

00:02:08.428 --> 00:02:10.930 align:start size:94% position:6%
and I thought that maybe
mine would be your favorites.

00:02:10.930 --> 00:02:11.498 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-I get it.

00:02:11.498 --> 00:02:13.199 align:start size:94% position:6%
Only smart people
get it, you know?

00:02:13.199 --> 00:02:14.701 align:start size:94% position:6%
-There were nights
where definitely

00:02:14.701 --> 00:02:18.471
only smart people got it,
and they were elsewhere.

00:02:18.471 --> 00:02:21.407 align:start size:94% position:6%
-No, I love all of
Kristen Wiig's sketches.

00:02:21.407 --> 00:02:22.842 align:start size:94% position:6%
-She's the best.
-So, she's the best.

00:02:22.842 --> 00:02:27.614 align:start size:94% position:6%
So, Target Lady
and Sue and Penelope

00:02:27.614 --> 00:02:28.281 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
and "just kidding."

00:02:28.281 --> 00:02:32.719
And they're all so good.
And the cowbell, obviously.

00:02:32.719 --> 00:02:34.587 align:start size:94% position:6%
Like, there's
so many great sketches.

00:02:34.587 --> 00:02:36.356 align:start size:94% position:6%
The Californians is probably
one of my favorites.

00:02:36.356 --> 00:02:37.824 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, that's fantastic.
There you go.

00:02:37.824 --> 00:02:38.925 line:92%
So, you have a lot of favorites.

00:02:38.925 --> 00:02:39.959 size:78% position:39% line:92%
-I so many favorites.

00:02:39.959 --> 00:02:42.395 align:start size:94% position:6%
-So, I want to ask --
So, in this film,

00:02:42.395 --> 00:02:45.098 align:start size:94% position:6%
you play an
American high-school student.

00:02:45.098 --> 00:02:47.000 size:88% position:44%
And it's very much about
an American high school.

00:02:47.000 --> 00:02:48.368 align:start size:94% position:6%
Even though it
takes place in Sacramento,

00:02:48.368 --> 00:02:50.937 align:start size:94% position:6%
I feel like it will feel like
everybody's high school

00:02:50.937 --> 00:02:51.738 line:92%
who grew up in this country.

00:02:51.738 --> 00:02:53.840 align:start size:94% position:6%
You, obviously,
did not grow up here.

00:02:53.840 --> 00:02:57.343
How did you connect to the idea
of American high school?

00:02:57.343 --> 00:02:59.379 line:92%
Like, what did you know of it?

00:02:59.379 --> 00:03:01.314 align:start size:94% position:6%
Did you know it
from pop culture?

00:03:01.314 --> 00:03:03.316 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, like,
"Saved by the Bell."

00:03:03.316 --> 00:03:05.185 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah.

00:03:05.185 --> 00:03:06.653 align:start size:94% position:6%
-That's how it is
in high school.

00:03:06.653 --> 00:03:09.322
-I will say -- I got a real
"Saved by the Bell" vibe

00:03:09.322 --> 00:03:10.456 line:92%
off your acting in this film.

00:03:10.456 --> 00:03:11.124 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Did you?
-Yeah.

00:03:11.124 --> 00:03:15.628 align:start size:94% position:6%
-"Hey. Hey, how's it going?"
-Yeah. [ Laughs ]

00:03:15.628 --> 00:03:18.198 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-"Oh, no. Class."

00:03:18.198 --> 00:03:19.866 align:start size:94% position:6%
Yeah, I think
everyone at home --

00:03:19.866 --> 00:03:22.402 align:start size:94% position:6%
Everyone outside
of America pretty much,

00:03:22.402 --> 00:03:24.437 align:start size:94% position:6%
definitely in
the Western World, obviously,

00:03:24.437 --> 00:03:25.872 align:start size:94% position:6%
grows up with
American pop culture.

00:03:25.872 --> 00:03:30.143
So, like, "Saved by the Bell"
and "Sabrina the Teenage Witch"

00:03:30.143 --> 00:03:31.411 size:81% position:41% line:92%
and "That's So Raven."

00:03:31.411 --> 00:03:32.712 line:92%
I thought -- Yeah, I know.

00:03:32.712 --> 00:03:34.814 align:start size:94% position:6%
I thought I was
psychic for so long.

00:03:34.814 --> 00:03:38.718 align:start size:94% position:6%
Genuinely, when I was a kid,
I used to do the look,

00:03:38.718 --> 00:03:39.552 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
and I thought --

00:03:39.552 --> 00:03:40.920 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Is that from the show
"That's So Raven"?

00:03:40.920 --> 00:03:42.855 align:start size:94% position:6%
-That's from "That's So --"
Do you not know that?

00:03:42.855 --> 00:03:44.524 size:78% position:39%
-No, I kind of missed
"That's So Raven."

00:03:44.524 --> 00:03:45.858 align:start size:94% position:6%
I mean, I'm familiar --
-Classic.

00:03:45.858 --> 00:03:47.293 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, I think I'd
aged out of it.

00:03:47.293 --> 00:03:48.628 align:start size:94% position:6%
I think, in my defense,
if I told people

00:03:48.628 --> 00:03:50.863
it was a show I watched,
it would have been creepy.

00:03:50.863 --> 00:03:52.065 line:92%
-It would have been worrying.

00:03:52.065 --> 00:03:53.967 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-Yeah.

